{"id":"22F","title":"Peace & Victory","part":{"n":22,"title":"Warfare and military laws"},"url":"/law/22-warfare-and-military-laws/22f","entries":[{"id":"22F.1","text":"There is a time for war and a time for peace.","refs":[{"book":"Ecclesiastes","chapter":3,"verses":"8"}],"citation":"Eccl. 3:8."},{"id":"22F.2","text":"If you walk in God's statutes and keep His commandments, and do them, He will give peace in the land, and none shall make you afraid.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":26,"verses":"3,6"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":119,"verses":"165"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":3,"verses":"1-2"},{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":16,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":32,"verses":"17-18"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":48,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Lev. 26:3,6; Psa. 119:165; Prov. 3:1-2; Prov. 16:7; Isa. 32:17-18; Isa. 48:18."},{"id":"22F.3","text":"Victory against enemies in war is from God.","refs":[{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":7,"verses":"23"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":20,"verses":"4"},{"book":"Joshua","chapter":10,"verses":"8-11"}],"citation":"Deut. 7:23; Deut. 20:4; Josh. 10:8- 11."},{"id":"22F.4","text":"God will bless His people with peace.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":29,"verses":"11"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":26,"verses":"2-3,12"},{"book":"Haggai","chapter":2,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Psa. 29:11; Isa. 26:2-3, 12; Hag. 2:9."},{"id":"22F.5","text":"The fear of God in our enemies can prevent war.","refs":[{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":17,"verses":"10"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":20,"verses":"29-30"}],"citation":"2 Chron. 17:10; 2 Chron. 20:29-30."},{"id":"22F.6","text":"God causes peace and wars to end.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":46,"verses":"9"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":147,"verses":"14"},{"book":"Isaiah","chapter":45,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"Psa. 46:9; Psa. 147:14; Isa. 45:7."},{"id":"22F.7","text":"When our ways please the LORD, He makes our enemies to be at peace with us.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":16,"verses":"7"}],"citation":"Prov. 16:7."},{"id":"22F.8","text":"In abundance of counselors there is safety.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":11,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"Prov. 11:14."},{"id":"22F.9","text":"Pray to God for deliverance from enemies, and that they may not triumph over you.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":25,"verses":"2"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":31,"verses":"15"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":59,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"Psa. 25:2; Psa. 31:15; Psa. 59:1."},{"id":"22F.10","text":"If a people listen to God and walk in His ways and turn to God with prayer and repentance, He will release them from captivity and subdue their enemies.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":23,"verses":"22,27"},{"book":"1 Kings","chapter":8,"verses":"46-50"},{"book":"2 Chronicles","chapter":6,"verses":"24-25,36-39"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":81,"verses":"14"}],"citation":"Exod. 23:22, 27; 1 Kings 8:46-50; 2 Chron. 6:24-25, 36-39; Psa. 81:14."},{"id":"22F.11","text":"The commandments of God make us wiser than our enemies.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":119,"verses":"98"}],"citation":"Psa. 119:98."},{"id":"22F.12","text":"Wisdom is better than weapons of war.","refs":[{"book":"Ecclesiastes","chapter":9,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Eccl. 9:18."}]}